OL,3,GNEWSAWarnings of more airport
OL,4,Adisruption as air traffic control
OL,5,Arecovery taking 'longer than hoped'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere are warnings of further
OL,8,Fdisruption after an issue with air
OL,9,Ftraffic control saw hundreds of flights
OL,10,Facross the UK on Tuesday cancelled or
OL,11,Fdelayed
OL,13,FNats, the air traffic control provider,
OL,14,Fhas said that recovery from the
OL,15,Fincident is "taking longer than hoped"
OL,17,FHeathrow, Manchester and East Midlands
OL,18,Fairports are among those that reported
OL,19,Fsignificant disruption, while airports
OL,20,Fin Scotland and Ireland have also
OL,21,Fexperienced delays
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
